      "How do I create a database user for a managed identity in Azure SQL Database",
      "Turn on Microsoft Entra-only authentication and enforce it with Azure Policy"
    ],
    "implicit": [
      "I get Principal could not be resolved when my pipeline runs CREATE USER",
      "I set the MSSQL_AAD variables on my local container, how do I let my app sign in with Entra ID now",
      "My app connects fine from my laptop but gets login failed for user token-identified principal once it is deployed",
      "CREATE USER FROM EXTERNAL PROVIDER says there is a duplicate display name",
      "I am the server admin and I still cannot create the Entra user",
      "How do I stop putting the SQL password in my configuration",
      "Which Authentication value do I put in the connection string for a user-assigned managed identity",
      "Cannot open database requested by the login. The login failed",
      "Login failed for user, what do I do"
    ],
    "routing": [
      "the grant step of an azd deployment, where the database side user and roles have to be created",
      "a login failure whose user name is an identity rather than a SQL login",
      "a decision between a system-assigned and a user-assigned managed identity for database access"
    ],
    "negative": [
